pe":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"てことで、今日はサイダーでも飲もうか〜♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは今日はこの辺で、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最後まで読んでくださりありがとうございます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ばいば〜い🦒"}],"source":"archive"},"sba-hinata-20499":{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":" \n \n \n ソニトピに\n 出演させてもらってます♡\n \n \n ぜひみてみてください！\n \n \n \n \n 頭文字の\n 上手に作れなかった〜〜>_<\n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHFYT0PTR2YY6NCG2DXN9E83","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n \n むむむ。\n \n \n \n \n \n あ、そういえば\n こないだ\n ファミレスちゃんと\n お清めに行ってきました(((o(*ﾟ▽ﾟ*)o)))\n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHFYT1XNEPWAHWRHXFB7PVRN","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n \n 可愛くなれますよーに\n 可愛くなれますよーに\n 可愛くなれますよーに。"}],"source":"archive"},"sba-hinata-21366":{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":" \n こんばちは\n \n 最早春休み同然の私は\n 唯一あるテストの存在さえも忘れていて\n 直前になって資料をかき集めてます。\n 一つだけなら絶対忘れないはずなのに、\n その一つさえも忘れてしまうとは、、、\n 思い出してよかった！\n \n 佐々木久美です。\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ0SZCCCS3XWFE7ETNNK0YFF","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n 実は写輪眼が開眼した日から\n コンタクト禁止令出てて、ずーっとメガネだったんです。\n \n 握手会の日だけ、\n お医者さんを裏切りました_(:3」z)_\n ごめんなさいお医者さん\n \n \n 視力はかなり悪くて、\n メガネかコンタクトしてないとなーんにも見えません。\n \n 小学生のときに急に目が悪くなって、\n 何でだろう〜〜って思ってたら\n 完全に遺伝ですねって言われて、\n そりゃしょうがないなってなりました。\n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ0SZDC0KM0F8EWYV56QWQAW","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n 伊達メガネじゃないんだぞ⊂((・x・))⊃\n \n \n \n 最近、テレビにブルーノマーズさんが\n たくさん出てて嬉しい！！！\n \n 大好きなんです〜〜\n \n 私って、本当に雑食で、\n 音楽は日本語も英語も韓国語も聞くし、\n 昭和の音楽から最新のまで好きで、\n だから好きなアーティストって聞かれると\n この人！！！っていうのがあまりない、、、\n \n 逆に、オススメされるとすぐハマります(・ω・)ノ\n \n だから、皆さんどんどんオススメの\n アーティストさんや曲を教えてください！\n \n \n に！\n \n \n \n ではまたね\\(　˙-˙　)/\n \n \n 佐々木久美"}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-21024":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さん\nおはようございます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"新内眞衣です！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/10/29/6035916/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/10/29/6035916/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何度目の青空か？カフェ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"遂に男性解禁になりました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おとといは初日ということで\nちょっとだけMGRやってきたよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/10/29/6035916/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お店の雰囲気とか\nいろいろどうだったかな？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"遊びに来てくれた方は\n是非感想をよろしくね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/10/29/6035916/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみに、この間は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かりん万理華さんかなさんが\n遊びに来てくれました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当はこの日、\nいるはずだったんだけど、\nお仕事入っちゃって\n行けなかったんです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/10/29/6035916/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"せっかくサプライズで\n来てくれたのに\n残念でした、、、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも私がいない間、\nカフェを盛り上げてくれようと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コースターやパネルに\nサインを書いたり"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"万理華さんは壁に\n絵を描いてくれたり\nしてました*\\(^o^)/*"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/10/29/6035916/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"素敵、、、♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3人ともありがとう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみに、\n私がいる時は名刺も\nプレゼントしてるよー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/10/29/6035916/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"残り1週間、、、！\n立ち寄れる方は是非是非\n来て見てくださいね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/10/29/6035916/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"個握"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"遅くなりましたが、\n個別握手会について！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この日は\nバタバタな1日でした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・1～3部 握手"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・2部終わり 未央奈 生誕祭"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・里沙子と京花のアルバム作成"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・空き時間に打ち合わせ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・5部 卒業セレモニー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とにかく\nなんかぎゅっとしてました笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ってなわけで！\n握手会レポ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1部 カフェ店員さん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/10/29/6035916/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何度目の青空か？カフェの\nスタイルのまま\n握手会に来て見ました！風"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんからもメンバーからも\nコーヒー頼まれることが\n多かったですね(*^_^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これはこれで楽しい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2部 アリスいんワンダーランド"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/10/29/6035916/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当、いい歳してすみませんでした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"半分以上の方に\nいじられましたよ。ええ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/10/29/6035916/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、中には\n可愛いと言ってくださる方もいて\n傷心の私には沁みました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3部 ダボダボスウェット"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/10/29/6035916/0010.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"のぎ天で行った\n下北の古着屋さんにて\n1500円でした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"休日に部屋着のまま\nコンビニに行くの巻"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"っていう裏設定。←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回も全部お洋服\n変えてみたんだけど\n皆さんはどれがお好み\nなのかな？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみに\n会話の内容は\nほぼアンダーライブ！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんたる影響力っっ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さん感想とかいろいろ\nありがとうございます！\nダンケっっ！！！←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"他にも"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"OL生活\nのぎ天\n急須\nOL走り\n青空カフェ\n3人の卒業について"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"などいろいろ話せました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回も楽しかったです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/10/29/6035916/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はじめましてさんも\nいつもぶりさんも\n久しぶりさんも"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"次は今週末っっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"会えるかたはよろしくね\n楽しみにしてるよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/10/29/6035916/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして卒業した里沙子、京花。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"里沙子"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"歳が近いということもあって、\nホテルで相部屋になったり、\n話すことも多かったね～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/10/29/6035916/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いろんな話をしたけど、\nいつも里沙子優しさに\nたくさん救われてました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初期の頃から\n学校と仕事との両立で\n悩んでたの知ってたけど、\nもう少し一緒に居たかったな。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最後にくれたお手紙に\nごめんね。って書かれて\n涙が止まりませんでした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夢がある里沙子を\nこれからもずっと応援してます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"京花"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"オーディションの時から\nお嬢様感しか出てなかった京花。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私の斜め前に座ってて、\n皆が話してても\n1人でずっと無言のままで\n居たのを今でも覚えてます。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"喋ると、いい意味で期待を裏切る\nフランク感、ぶっとんでる感が\n大好きで、よく一緒にいたなあ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"神宮では楽屋裏で\n目が合って2人同んなじ\nタイミングで泣きました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"多分、京花も同じ事を\n考えていたはず。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"真面目な事とかは\nあまり語らなかったけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"通じるものがあったよね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2人とも\n本当に1年半ありがとう！\nこれからもよろしくね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/10/29/6035916/0012.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"てなわけでりさよねスペシャル"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お披露目前"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/10/29/6035916/0013.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初ステージ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/10/29/6035916/0014.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会シリーズ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/10/29/6035916/0015.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/10/29/6035916/0016.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.